    ["Changes to a page aren’t live", "Content changes are instant; code/design changes need to be pushed and auto-deployed by Vercel (Section 14)."],
  ],
  [3400, 5600],
));

// 19. Maintenance
S(H1("19.  Routine Maintenance"));
S(bullet("Weekly: check Responses for new enquiries and export a CSV backup."));
S(bullet("Keep product and project content and images up to date as your range evolves."));
S(bullet("Review the Privacy Policy and Terms pages periodically with your legal advisor."));
S(bullet("Renew your domain registration before it expires (a lapsed domain takes the site offline)."));
S(bullet("Ensure your Supabase and Vercel accounts remain active and in good standing."));

// 20. Support
S(H1("20.  Support & Key Accounts"));
S(P("Keep a private record of the logins and owners for each service the site relies on:"));
S(table(
  ["Service", "Used for", "Account owner"],
